    /// |`<`  or `>=`| `&`  |`x & 2 < 3`  |`true`   |`m < c`               |
    /// |`>`  or `<=`| `&`  |`x & 1 > 1`  |`false`  |`m <= c`              |
    /// |`==` or `!=`| `\|` |`x \| 1 == 0`|`false`  |`c \| m != c`         |
    /// |`<`  or `>=`| `\|` |`x \| 1 < 1` |`false`  |`m >= c`              |
    /// |`<=` or `>` | `\|` |`x \| 1 > 0` |`true`   |`m > c`               |
    ///
