    /// ### What it does
    /// Warns if the digits of an integral or floating-point
    /// constant are grouped into groups that
    /// are too large.
    ///
    /// ### Why is this bad?
    /// Negatively impacts readability.
    ///
    /// ### Example
    /// ```rust
    /// let x: u64 = 6186491_8973511;
